# A numeric function specializes after NUMERIC_SPECIALIZE_AFTER calls and then runs from a variant
# at its own code offset. chunk_find_function_by_offset knows only the generic offset unless it also
# scans specializations[], so the function every trace most wants named was the one it could not.
#!in: accumulate()

function accumulate(total, step):
    scaled = total * 2 + step
    return scaled // step   #!error: Division by zero

i = 0
for i < 40:
    r = accumulate(i, 3)
    i += 1

r = accumulate(7, 0)
